# Source file for pip-compile - run `pip-compile requirements.in` to
# regenerate requirements.txt with every transitive dependency pinned.
#
# apache-airflow is deliberately NOT listed here (see the bottom of
# requirements.txt) - Airflow publishes its own official constraints file
# per release specifically because generic dependency resolution can pick
# versions its own release process never tested together. Let Airflow's
# constraints govern that one package; pip-compile governs everything else.

